  Briefing: 'The Swarm vanguard has breached the orbital defense grid.

    Clear
    the debris field and stop the drones before they reach the surface.


    Drag
    to move. The Vanguard fires automatically.

    Tap the energy bar (or press
    E) to unleash the Ultimate when it is full.'
